#* {{quote-book|en|year=2022|author=w:Ling Ma|title=Bliss Montage|chapter=Tomorrow|location=New York|publisher=Farrar, Straus and Giroux|isbn=978-0-374-71712-4|passage=That, and her '''IUD''', which had become so deeply embedded in her uterine lining that only the uninsured process of surgical extraction could remove it, had created a false narrative of childlessness.}}
